# field-open (h8-points-field): P's x field opened from Enter on the slider.
# Click the number, Escape (focus back on the slider), Enter (the slider's
# Enter opens the field): the text selected, the editing ring, the normal
# tip under the head. Behaviour: the URL unchanged, the field "2.00" with
# data-editing, the tip "Enter apply - nudge 0.01".
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 293 716
wait 150
key Escape
wait 150
key Enter
wait 300
shot field-open
